    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/981164a1479a6fc4ffdce48361cc1610.poster.avif?t=1745380067\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/981164a1479a6fc4ffdce48361cc1610.webm?t=1745380067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/981164a1479a6fc4ffdce48361cc1610.mp4?t=1745380067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHIMP WAR takes a refreshing turn away from other more tactical FPS games (and even some movement shooters). Movement is much more fast paced, you can rocket jump, double jump, deploy unique abilities and use unique weapons like freeze grenades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both chimpanzees and humans have unique classes of abilities and guns. All buildings are fully destructible and all maps have  vehicles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/9c39d5704c7c4f67eac777384a742f4e.poster.avif?t=1745380067\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/9c39d5704c7c4f67eac777384a742f4e.webm?t=1745380067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/9c39d5704c7c4f67eac777384a742f4e.mp4?t=1745380067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All kinds of weapons:</strong>\u00a0 freeze grenades, rifles, life-steal crossbows, flare guns and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles:\u00a0</strong> including tanks, transport vehicles, a military helicopter, planes, boats and quad-bikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insanely fast movement:\u00a0\u00a0</strong>double jumping, rocket jumping, launchers across the maps and jetpacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique game modes:\u00a0</strong> free-for-all, team deathmatch, capture the flag and point capture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible</strong> environment and collapsible buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online <strong>multiplayer</strong> gameplay and a single-player mode with bots</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/ebde96f692acacf2daf3dcea766a1ff5.avif?t=1745380067\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/981164a1479a6fc4ffdce48361cc1610.poster.avif?t=1745380067\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/981164a1479a6fc4ffdce48361cc1610.webm?t=1745380067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/981164a1479a6fc4ffdce48361cc1610.mp4?t=1745380067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHIMP WAR takes a refreshing turn away from other more tactical FPS games (and even some movement shooters). Movement is much more fast paced, you can rocket jump, double jump, deploy unique abilities and use unique weapons like freeze grenades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both chimpanzees and humans have unique classes of abilities and guns. All buildings are fully destructible and all maps have  vehicles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/9c39d5704c7c4f67eac777384a742f4e.poster.avif?t=1745380067\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/9c39d5704c7c4f67eac777384a742f4e.webm?t=1745380067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/9c39d5704c7c4f67eac777384a742f4e.mp4?t=1745380067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All kinds of weapons:</strong>\u00a0 freeze grenades, rifles, life-steal crossbows, flare guns and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles:\u00a0</strong> including tanks, transport vehicles, a military helicopter, planes, boats and quad-bikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insanely fast movement:\u00a0\u00a0</strong>double jumping, rocket jumping, launchers across the maps and jetpacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique game modes:\u00a0</strong> free-for-all, team deathmatch, capture the flag and point capture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible</strong> environment and collapsible buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online <strong>multiplayer</strong> gameplay and a single-player mode with bots</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672050/extras/ebde96f692acacf2daf3dcea766a1ff5.avif?t=1745380067\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A multiplayer movement FPS where a chimpanzees are at war with humans. Deploy unique abilities, and use explosives in a fully destructible environment. Bring your opponent to submission with unique guns, tanks, helicopters, boats, quad-bikes, explosives and rapid movement!",
